+      decide_eq_true_eq, «_<=Int_», «_<Int_»] at h
+    rcases h with ⟨⟨⟨⟨⟨⟨hBody, hReturn⟩, hScope⟩, hBuiltins⟩,
+      hPhaseLo⟩, hPhaseHi⟩, hValid⟩
