+      (candidateLoopSound
+        (SortIntSeq.«iCons(_,_)_MPY-CORE_IntSeq_Int_IntSeq» CODE REST)
+        XARG NARG P A B C D OLDCH _Gen0 _Gen1 hValid)
+  · intro _Gen1 _Gen0 BUILTINSSCOPE CALLEESCOPE RETSTMTS LOOPBODY
+      REST D C B A P OLDCH NARG XARG h
