The timeout is caused by forcing the large whole-configuration goal while Lean is inferring the lookup rule’s map witnesses—not by a missing semantic premise. I’m moving that same rule into a narrowly typed helper whose source and target configurations fix all witnesses explicitly; its premises will still be discharged by unfolding the generated Base map model.
apply patch
